OL,3,AOutrage in India over viral video of
OL,4,Ateen molested and her friend beaten
OL,5,
OL,6,FA video showing a teenaged girl being
OL,7,Fsexually assaulted and her male friend
OL,8,Fbeaten by a group of men in India's
OL,9,FBihar state has sparked widespread
OL,10,Foutrage.
OL,12,FThe school students, both minors, were
OL,13,Fstopped in Jamui district on 19
OL,14,FSeptember. Footage shared widely online
OL,15,Fshows them surrounded and repeatedly
OL,16,Fpleading to be allowed to leave.
OL,18,FThe boy is seen being slapped and
OL,19,Fpulled by his collar, while the girl is
OL,20,Ftouched inappropriately and, in another
OL,21,Fclip, carried away by a man as the boy
OL,22,Ftries to intervene.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
